hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1207","Ali bin Abdul Rahman bin Al-Mughirah Al-Misri told us, Ibn Abi Maryam told us, Ibn Farukh told us, on the authority of Ibn Jurayj, on the authority of Ata’, on the authority of Anas bin Malik, who said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “Honor your homes with some of your prayers.”"
